sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant A as Apache
  participant F as Front controller
  participant R as Router
  participant C as Controller
  participant M as Model
  participant D as PDO/MySQL
  participant V as View/Layout
  U->>A: HTTP request
  A->>F: Rewrite dynamic path
  F->>R: Dispatch method and path
  R->>C: Invoke matched action
  C->>M: Validate and invoke use case
  M->>D: Prepared query or transaction
  D-->>M: Rows/result
  M-->>C: Data/result
  C->>V: Render template or redirect
  V-->>U: HTML response
